ex:Mission8 backlog:hasMissionOutcome "Chapters 19 (Keeping Time, Scheduling Tasks and Launching Programs) and 20 (Sending Email, Texts and Push Notifications) are taught with a deck and an interactive page each: ch19 deck 2.2.0 and page 9.97.2, ch20 deck 2.0.1 and page 9.99.1, built to the rulings of 2026-11-14." ;
    backlog:outcomeRationale "All 22 backlog items Done; page test 412 of 412 on both pages; deck standard check 1.1.0 13 of 13 on both decks (declared measure replaced from 1.0.0 on the owner's confirmation of 2026-11-18). Not shown: the three-role review was made by the building agent and is not independent; links were not re-opened this session; 8 of 19 chapter examples show their recorded result instead of running in the browser. Corrections to chapters 18 and earlier follow by change management." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
